# Alertmanager token — generated by scripts/generate-alertmanager-token.sh.
# Contains a live JWT service token. Never commit to git.
#
# Fixed: this previously said "docker/secrets/.env", a filename that
# doesn't match anything the script actually generates
# (docker/secrets/alertmanager-token) — meaning the real secret file was
# never actually excluded. Ignoring the whole directory's contents now,
# not just one specific filename, so any future secret written there is
# covered too.
docker/secrets/*
!docker/secrets/.gitkeep
